    {
      "order": 4,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0140",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-s001",
      "sentenceText": "So, who is likely to lead a psychologically rich life?",
      "sentenceSha256": "43d7f05d70aa5d7de195f686c4f0065d0fe1796edea08097a42f664b46d8d9aa",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-084",
      "parentFingerprint": "2fc9eb0fb343d2a26487e99f9b9a5323de4755979fe6074015faba8b567c3413",
      "passageSha256": "cf7e33bfc4d3b41a02959f85ed4199a7410fe1719bfe4b07d3b0fcd75f5dfc43",
      "pdfPages": [
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0141",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-s002",
      "sentenceText": "In terms of personality traits, people who are open to experience and extraverted are most likely to lead a psychologically rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "fa236fdc2c3592057e026e2fc32d59a84f2513cd6d62cf20b3bee7be3e1d9fac",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-084",
      "parentFingerprint": "2fc9eb0fb343d2a26487e99f9b9a5323de4755979fe6074015faba8b567c3413",
      "passageSha256": "cf7e33bfc4d3b41a02959f85ed4199a7410fe1719bfe4b07d3b0fcd75f5dfc43",
      "pdfPages": [
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0142",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-s003",
      "sentenceText": "They are more likely to do something new, meet someone new, or learn something new, like Goldmund in Narcissus and Goldmund.",
      "sentenceSha256": "2934044a6f610f9c465c0f3d7c29a03a44a1c4bce80d37a38d54bb55654baa43",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-084",
      "parentFingerprint": "2fc9eb0fb343d2a26487e99f9b9a5323de4755979fe6074015faba8b567c3413",
      "passageSha256": "cf7e33bfc4d3b41a02959f85ed4199a7410fe1719bfe4b07d3b0fcd75f5dfc43",
      "pdfPages": [
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0143",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-s005",
      "sentenceText": "There are plenty of introverts who lead a psychologically rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "a1ac0b20b93ce02bf3ef31441d6bba5a3e2a9cc4d369fc5188dc4b8a25e581af",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-085",
      "parentFingerprint": "c7c9998be47570d9e2a4596f59f3cce8b47599abc1957b7cf92e848fccabf647",
      "passageSha256": "b5e1453c790890402e2a4d92f9d9dee793392cc3c9ee390b46f41e750232b356",
      "pdfPages": [
        65,
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0144",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-s007",
      "sentenceText": "Likewise, Joy Ryan went to so many national parks with her grandson Brad.",
      "sentenceSha256": "61d510cc5325f785a3d3c68425ab82539d846a2bb06ea7657d161fd24fc7b8d8",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-085",
      "parentFingerprint": "c7c9998be47570d9e2a4596f59f3cce8b47599abc1957b7cf92e848fccabf647",
      "passageSha256": "b5e1453c790890402e2a4d92f9d9dee793392cc3c9ee390b46f41e750232b356",
      "pdfPages": [
        65,
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0145",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-s009",
      "sentenceText": "It should be noted that conscientiousness, agreeableness, and emotional stability are secondarily predictors of a rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d182672ce6caf2592330c6e42f352cf2582fb1c7505da3d8dfdd39372d1b6324",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-r009-012",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c06-086",
      "parentFingerprint": "2746d72d05b641e502da8beb626ea470006db24ddc2af4984e1cacda456134c0",
      "passageSha256": "7b479a3f64d65ecc549a933e84860d96336adaaad89752128a54c59ea7465745",
      "pdfPages": [
        66
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "questionId": "qe-c06-0146",
      "sentenceId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-s012",
      "sentenceText": "There really are numerous ways to lead a psychologically rich life.",
      "sentenceSha256": "d9ac1dffab105647a4713ca25a58f2643c6159878c135001456865c55b69de6a",
      "readingUnitId": "c06-s07-p065-05745-r009-012",
