    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0001",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-s001",
      "sentenceText": "At the core of a psychologically rich personality are openness to experience and extraversion.",
      "sentenceSha256": "e0a660f510a6918333a06783d894702007abc04e84aa2714e74b73c01bd2cf5c",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "333bc8494e8a4e2fe8fceaddb1df36b7d2cf1da12e497824169f625f73c98054",
      "passageSha256": "93f051abb326ad6eafd6855bc7f1d50051250458f611439bfd5461d2791dd1eb",
      "pdfPages": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 20,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0002",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-s002",
      "sentenceText": "One might ask, though: How can those of us who don’t have those basic personality traits become more open and extraverted?",
      "sentenceSha256": "505702d168eeb54ec83d96a546024e014b3bdc48734557b3870f1f2f9c0274b6",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "333bc8494e8a4e2fe8fceaddb1df36b7d2cf1da12e497824169f625f73c98054",
      "passageSha256": "93f051abb326ad6eafd6855bc7f1d50051250458f611439bfd5461d2791dd1eb",
      "pdfPages": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 21,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0003",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-s003",
      "sentenceText": "One answer is to embrace playfulness.",
      "sentenceSha256": "c2386c6832f9711cc4c152f91e97f184d907ce1b2036eae5f4ca21a1f760aba1",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-001",
      "parentFingerprint": "333bc8494e8a4e2fe8fceaddb1df36b7d2cf1da12e497824169f625f73c98054",
      "passageSha256": "93f051abb326ad6eafd6855bc7f1d50051250458f611439bfd5461d2791dd1eb",
      "pdfPages": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 22,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0004",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-s005",
      "sentenceText": "For instance, a man high in openness to experience said, “When my wife asked me to do the housework, I invented an urgent excuse.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "fba61e16eef187aab5fb8363072754cc081662acd96877d19d740ee0d50dbf43",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-002",
      "parentFingerprint": "22c6a6162f58d80a04f8e4ea18ca63107cba179ea2f825d9779751b1ed307fbf",
      "passageSha256": "2559e4a61cea6602b5d5ffb6d5be1d1d3dab04f59239e170d2222430c8effae5",
      "pdfPages": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 23,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0005",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-s008",
      "sentenceText": "A slight twist may be given to meanings, and obviously playful objections to the test are frequently made.”",
      "sentenceSha256": "3e440f707d04757acb6ac7648791865676147becf00adff512bad0660c174eef",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p068-03262-r005-008",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-002",
      "parentFingerprint": "22c6a6162f58d80a04f8e4ea18ca63107cba179ea2f825d9779751b1ed307fbf",
      "passageSha256": "2559e4a61cea6602b5d5ffb6d5be1d1d3dab04f59239e170d2222430c8effae5",
      "pdfPages": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 24,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0006",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p068-06188-s001",
      "sentenceText": "But what exactly is being playful?",
      "sentenceSha256": "b3776a5e2983a50e45a48c37e9cd97952e2dd984c1b2b7ead9eb53859ebe9639",
      "readingUnitId": "c07-s01-p068-06188-r001-004",
      "parentQuestionId": "q-c07-004",
      "parentFingerprint": "92306031669b72900de34b83bc2474b2a324f55aa580a760f5ce5b556008fbce",
      "passageSha256": "0f69c92f2161a69f87622f14f684f56bad5de6bea79dcb759d14f10ea994eac4",
      "pdfPages": [
        68
      ]
    },
    {
      "order": 25,
      "questionId": "qe-c07-0007",
      "sentenceId": "c07-s01-p068-06188-s003",
      "sentenceText": "All of us adults have a lot of social and economic responsibilities.",
      "sentenceSha256": "b5558576e3d4e800fd8e14a739f08e8b8a7941ac82723cccb47dbc13f1008b7f",
